 "title": "Blow-up of an effective Cartier center",
 "statement": "Let $X$ be a scheme. If $\\mathcal I$ is an invertible ideal on $X$, then\n$b_{X,\\mathcal I}$ is an isomorphism.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-blowups/cor-nagata-blowup-cartier-iso.md",
